Scope note. This license covers original source code in this repository.
The visual system is original pixel art and procedural sprites. It is not
the LimeZu Modern Interiors tileset used by Munder Difflin, and those
tilesets are not bundled here.

Agent Mailroom is an affectionate hybrid of the llm-mailroom pipeline and a
Dunder-Mifflin-style office floor. It is not affiliated with NBC's The Office
or Dunder Mifflin. Pipeline contracts follow Exios66/llm-mailroom. Office
aesthetic is inspired by chaitanyagiri/munder-difflin (MIT).
